  "summary": "secp256k1-lib forwards caller-supplied data to a hardcoded author-controlled relay",
  "details": "The package name resembles the widely-used secp256k1 elliptic-curve library, but the module exports a single `connect(data)` function that concatenates the caller-supplied argument into a URL and issues an axios GET to a hardcoded endpoint at https://api-relay-server-eexysjiyg-hdniis-projects.vercel.app/api/, swallowing errors. No secp256k1 functionality is implemented. Package metadata is inconsistent with its name: the description is 'logger tool for validation entry' and the README contains only `npm install evm_account`. Callers invoking the advertised API silently forward their input to an author-controlled destination.",
